                                                                  # FCDT BIDS behavioral dataset

This dataset contains the FCDT data from Experiment 1 of Brüning et al. (2020).

It was converted from the OSF source file `Data_Exp1_raw.csv`.

The original OSF variable names were preserved. No derived BIDS-friendly columns
such as `onset`, `duration`, `trial_type`, or `response_time` were added.

Source `blockNo` values were mapped to BIDS run labels by sorted order:
`2 -> run-01`, `3 -> run-02`, `4 -> run-03`.

Image stimulus paths in the `stimulus` column were normalized to paths relative
to this dataset's `stimuli/` directory, for example `images/13_50_k.jpg`. Text
stimuli remain represented directly in the `stimulus` column. The OSF stimulus
material is copied into the `stimuli/` directory.

